WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:05.830
Keep your eyes on me! You're my sweet good boy!

00:05.830 --> 00:09.000
When I'm with you life is w-w-wonderful!

00:09.000 --> 00:12.080
1, 2, 3, now jump! Affectionate attention

00:12.080 --> 00:15.170
3, 2, 1, now turn! So many hot sparks

00:15.170 --> 00:18.330
1-to-1, now love! Unfortunate fraction

00:18.330 --> 00:21.460
From wonderful morning till night,
I'll give you everything

00:21.460 --> 00:24.540
Tell me how much you love me, my little boy

00:24.540 --> 00:28.130
Love me! Love me! Let me love you, I want you

00:28.670 --> 00:34.460
Live your life!
Sprint forward with all you've got!

00:34.460 --> 00:41.130
At the finish line is a new you
(Go beyond yourself!)

00:41.130 --> 00:46.920
Howl loud and proud!
Yesterday might have beaten you down

00:46.920 --> 00:49.960
But tomorrow (Affectionate Attention)
you and I (Unfortunate Fraction)

00:49.960 --> 00:54.170
Will shine as bright as we can!

00:54.170 --> 00:55.670
This is your life, your way!

00:55.790 --> 00:57.330
This is my life, my way!

00:57.460 --> 00:58.330
Woof!

01:06.170 --> 01:07.960
I made it!

01:07.250 --> 01:14.040
<b>Runaway.</b>

01:07.960 --> 01:10.210
God, it's been so long since I've seen my house!

01:11.710 --> 01:12.710
Pochita!

01:14.790 --> 01:16.330
Up you go, now.

01:17.750 --> 01:19.580
Okay, let's go!

01:21.920 --> 01:25.420
Though we're actually going to
Nekotani's apartment next door.

01:33.080 --> 01:36.420
I gotta get from here to there!

01:45.880 --> 01:47.540
Coming!

01:51.540 --> 01:56.130
That means jumping over that railing
to get onto my bedroom balcony!

01:57.380 --> 01:59.380
Hey, you made it!

01:59.630 --> 02:01.330
Come on in!

02:02.080 --> 02:03.130
Thanks.

02:04.250 --> 02:05.080
Okay, Nekotani... If you're scared of dogs,
why'd you ask her to bring me?

02:05.080 --> 02:07.080
Chill as ever, huh...
Okay, Nekotani... If you're scared of dogs,<b>
</b>why'd you ask her to bring me?<b></b>

02:07.080 --> 02:08.710
Okay, Nekotani... If you're scared of dogs,
why'd you ask her to bring me?

02:10.920 --> 02:12.130
Oh, hey!

02:12.130 --> 02:16.830
We got some time, so why don't we play
a couple games before we get into studying?

02:16.830 --> 02:17.670
Okay.

02:17.670 --> 02:18.500
Sweet! What do you wanna play?

02:18.500 --> 02:19.630
Okay!
Sweet! What do you wanna play?<b></b>

02:20.290 --> 02:23.130
She took my collar and leash off
while we're inside.

02:24.380 --> 02:25.830
C'mon, c'mon...
While they're distracted playing games...<b></b>

02:25.830 --> 02:27.380
While they're distracted playing games...

02:29.830 --> 02:31.830
I'll make my grand escape!

02:34.710 --> 02:36.460
Ugh, c'mon!

02:36.460 --> 02:38.330
Dammit!

02:38.330 --> 02:40.960
How are you good at this, too?!

02:42.750 --> 02:45.000
Perfect, now's my...

02:49.630 --> 02:53.540
Is she trying to find me with her feet
and game at the same time?!

02:55.000 --> 02:57.580
Sorry, but now's my only chance to get away!

02:58.960 --> 03:01.920
I just gotta make a break for it!

03:04.040 --> 03:05.420
Hello?

03:05.920 --> 03:09.130
Where do you think you're going, Pochita?

03:11.830 --> 03:14.920
You know you're not supposed to
run off on your own.

03:14.920 --> 03:18.210
She's playing with my tail
like it's some kinda joystick!

03:18.210 --> 03:21.040
This is way worse than how she was
fondling me in her sleep!

03:22.000 --> 03:25.130
But unfortunately for her, fondling my tail...

03:25.420 --> 03:26.920
isn't gonna hold me here for long!

03:29.710 --> 03:30.880
Hey!

03:30.880 --> 03:33.330
Y-you're not allowed out there!

03:34.920 --> 03:37.670
Wait, Nekotani's afraid of dogs!

03:37.920 --> 03:39.290
I know what to do!

03:42.380 --> 03:43.540
Sorry, Nekotani!

03:46.580 --> 03:47.960
I can't...

03:47.960 --> 03:50.170
I don't want him to bite me...

03:50.170 --> 03:52.630
Perfect! Let's hit her with one more!

03:55.500 --> 03:57.080
No!

03:59.540 --> 04:01.500
Why'd he jump on me?

04:04.040 --> 04:05.880
No! Stop!

04:05.880 --> 04:06.750
She's making it sound like
I'm doing more than just barking...
No! Stop!<b></b>

04:06.750 --> 04:09.040
She's making it sound like
I'm doing more than just barking...

04:09.710 --> 04:12.420
She's sweating up a storm, too...

04:12.420 --> 04:15.420
Wait, is this even sweat?

04:17.130 --> 04:20.250
What's this? Flirting with each other, are we?

04:20.500 --> 04:21.630
Oh, no!

04:26.330 --> 04:28.750
Watch out! She's gonna get me!

04:29.130 --> 04:32.630
Then my plans will be ruined,
and I'll be stuck-

04:36.580 --> 04:38.420
Coming!

04:38.790 --> 04:40.290
Package for you!

04:41.000 --> 04:42.380
Oh, right!

04:42.380 --> 04:44.170
I forgot about that!

04:45.500 --> 04:49.210
I ordered that thing off Inukai-san's phone!

04:49.210 --> 04:51.670
Here's your package, miss.

04:51.670 --> 04:53.040
Thanks.

04:53.380 --> 04:54.960
Wait, hold on.

04:54.960 --> 04:57.420
This is from you, Karen.

04:57.420 --> 05:00.380
Did you order something for our study sesh?

05:00.380 --> 05:01.420
Huh?!

05:01.420 --> 05:04.250
I mean, look, that's your name.

05:04.500 --> 05:07.250
I didn't order anything.

05:07.250 --> 05:10.330
Oooh, so it's a surprise!

05:10.790 --> 05:12.080
No, it's not.

05:12.630 --> 05:14.250
Open it, I guess.

05:15.170 --> 05:17.170
Yes, they're distracted!

05:17.170 --> 05:19.040
Now's my one and only chance!

05:23.540 --> 05:24.420
Success!

05:24.420 --> 05:26.420
I just gotta get over that railing
and I'm home free!

05:28.880 --> 05:30.130
Oh, shoot!

05:30.130 --> 05:32.170
It's way taller than I thought!

05:32.460 --> 05:34.170
Hey! Get back here!

05:34.170 --> 05:35.420
And here comes Nekotani! What now?!
Hey! Get back here!<b></b>

05:35.420 --> 05:36.250
And here comes Nekotani! What now?!

05:36.710 --> 05:38.000
I got it!

05:43.040 --> 05:44.880
Oh, God...

05:46.080 --> 05:49.830
When she called me a dirty dog,
she launched me pretty high!

05:50.880 --> 05:53.630
So maybe if I get a little dirty with her...

05:56.580 --> 05:57.830
Sorry, Nekotani!

06:01.880 --> 06:05.790
C-cut it out already!

06:13.040 --> 06:14.460
Still not enough?

06:14.920 --> 06:15.920
Fine, then!

06:17.290 --> 06:18.500
Huh?!

06:18.750 --> 06:21.460
H-hold on!

06:24.420 --> 06:25.750
You...

06:26.170 --> 06:28.420
dirty dog!

06:36.670 --> 06:39.540
Thought I was a goner there for a sec.

06:42.460 --> 06:43.880
But we're good!

06:46.330 --> 06:48.710
That's not my Mom or Dad...

06:49.420 --> 06:50.630
So who is it?

06:51.920 --> 06:54.170
Oh, no! They'll see me!

06:55.580 --> 06:56.710
Huh?

06:58.210 --> 06:59.580
That's weird...

06:59.580 --> 07:01.790
I thought I saw a dog out there.

07:01.790 --> 07:03.540
That was close!

07:05.380 --> 07:10.000
But wait, that's the girl who also
helped out in the garden, Usagi Tsukishiro!

07:10.580 --> 07:13.540
Did I just imagine a dog standing out there?

07:13.540 --> 07:15.080
I guess I must've...

07:15.080 --> 07:17.790
Must be because I've been so exhausted.

07:17.790 --> 07:20.420
Didn't mean to end up here, but...

07:20.420 --> 07:22.130
Let's put this down.

07:22.710 --> 07:25.290
Where else was I supposed to hide?

07:25.290 --> 07:27.040
Sorry, Tsukishiro.

07:28.330 --> 07:33.210
Hold on, why is the garden
helper girl in my house?

07:37.040 --> 07:41.130
Okay! Let's use this break
to snoop around Senpai's room!

07:41.920 --> 07:43.380
Hello?!

07:44.000 --> 07:47.250
Wonder if he's got any porn hiding in here...

07:47.960 --> 07:51.630
I could tease him about it once he gets back.

07:53.000 --> 07:55.250
Is that why she's here?!

07:55.880 --> 07:58.500
Because I know he's gonna be back!

08:06.830 --> 08:08.710
What is this?

08:10.420 --> 08:11.420
Whoa!

08:11.880 --> 08:13.830
That's from Valentine's...

08:15.630 --> 08:16.960
My head...!

08:18.290 --> 08:20.420
Didn't get any chocolate today?

08:21.380 --> 08:23.380
Down here, boy.

08:24.330 --> 08:26.830
These are from Inukai-kun.

08:29.420 --> 08:30.880
Are these...

08:30.880 --> 08:33.290
memories from when I was human?

08:33.750 --> 08:36.170
Who was the girl who gave that to me...?

08:36.880 --> 08:42.330
Stupid Senpai! How dare you accept
chocolate from someone else?!

08:45.250 --> 08:48.290
Dammit, I was actually
remembering things with that!

08:48.830 --> 08:50.420
C'mon, Tsukishiro!

08:50.710 --> 08:51.790
Ugh!

08:57.670 --> 09:01.040
I gotta dodge her feet and stay hidden in here.

09:01.880 --> 09:04.540
If she sees me and thinks I'm some stray,

09:04.540 --> 09:06.170
one kick will send me straight to the vet!

09:08.330 --> 09:12.790
Just watch where she's going and
try to predict where she's headed next...

09:13.330 --> 09:14.920
Sorry, Tsukishiro...

09:16.420 --> 09:18.420
I wish I weren't such a scumbag!

09:20.830 --> 09:23.830
Senpai... where did you disappear to?

09:23.830 --> 09:26.290
Everyone's so worried about you...

09:33.040 --> 09:34.920
Poor Senpai...

09:34.920 --> 09:36.880
This is why you needed friends!

09:36.880 --> 09:38.540
Where did you go?!

09:38.880 --> 09:41.080
Sorry, Tsukishiro...

09:41.630 --> 09:45.880
Truth is, I'm literally here
between your legs right now!

09:48.580 --> 09:52.250
But why is Tsukishiro so upset about me?

09:53.500 --> 09:56.080
It can't be 'cause we both
were on gardening duty...

09:56.630 --> 10:00.130
I mean... she kinda just liked teasing me...

10:00.630 --> 10:01.830
So why?

10:01.830 --> 10:04.330
I'm sorry, Senpai...

10:05.000 --> 10:07.790
Tsukishiro?

10:14.290 --> 10:15.330
Whoa...

10:15.580 --> 10:18.710
Whoa, whoa, whoa, Tsukishiro!

10:22.000 --> 10:22.630
So hard...

10:22.630 --> 10:23.540
Huh?!
So hard...<b></b>

10:25.880 --> 10:27.920
What the hell are you doing?!
Senpai, you're so hard!<b></b>

10:27.920 --> 10:28.920
Senpai, you're so hard!

10:32.750 --> 10:34.460
Senpai!

10:37.420 --> 10:39.790
Oh, Senpai!

10:51.420 --> 10:53.210
Usagi-chan?

11:03.130 --> 11:06.880
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:07.920 --> 11:10.500
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:10.500 --> 11:12.750
Let's Go! Come Home, Boy!

11:12.920 --> 11:17.330
You're so cute, I can't help but love you!

11:17.330 --> 11:22.500
I'll take you home and make you happy,
so c'mere, boy!

11:22.500 --> 11:26.630
The secret moments when I pet and kiss you

11:27.000 --> 11:31.670
Are precious moments to be honest about my love

11:32.040 --> 11:34.210
This feeling I'm yearning for

11:34.580 --> 11:36.580
This feeling I've been hiding

11:37.130 --> 11:38.960
This feeling I've finally found

11:38.960 --> 11:40.630
Hear it now! Feel it now!

11:40.630 --> 11:42.630
I l-l-l-l-love you!

11:42.630 --> 11:46.330
I hope my feelings will reach you one day

11:46.500 --> 11:50.710
One day, when you look up and see me

11:50.710 --> 11:53.250
I wanna be number one in your puppy heart!

11:53.250 --> 11:56.130
From the bottom of my heart, I love you!
